# Coveralls serves 403 Forbidden to unauthenticated link checkers, so the
# README badge fails lychee even though the page renders in a browser (and
# the repo's Coveralls upload is currently broken anyway — LAUNCH_CHECKLIST
# tracks fixing the token). Remove once the badge resolves for lychee.
https://coveralls.io/github/jarvisfriends/tui-base

# The README gallery gifs are release assets attached by goreleaser
# (release.extra_files), so these URLs 404 until the first tag cut AFTER the
# demo-pipeline port ships them. Remove these three lines once that release
# exists, so a broken gallery link fails CI again — snap went through the
# same dance.
https://github.com/jarvisfriends/tui-base/releases/latest/download/tour.gif
https://github.com/jarvisfriends/tui-base/releases/latest/download/multipage.gif
https://github.com/jarvisfriends/tui-base/releases/latest/download/notifications.gif
